The simplest way to represent a stack is by using a one-dimensional Array say stack[0 : n-1 ], 
where n is the maximum number of allowable entries. 
Another way to represent a stack is by using links. A node is a collection of data and link 
information. A stack can be represented using nodes with two fields, possibly called data  
and link. 
