This application that illustrates the different types of  stacks and various operations 
and functions defined upon them. 
Consider the sum of  A and B. We think of applying the operator “+” to the 
operands Aand B and white the sum as A+B. this particular representation is called infix. 
There are two alternate notations for expressing the sum of Aand B using the symbols A,B, 
and +. These are 
+AB prefix 
AB+ postfix

