Double Ended Queue 
Insertion and deletion can be performed from both sides. To insert an element at rear position 
increase rear value by 1. If rear=size-1 Queue is full insertion not possible. To insert an 
element at front decrease front value by 1, If front=0, insertion not possible. 
To delete an element from rear position, decrement the rear. To delete an element from front, 
increase front, if front > rear Queue is empty. 
